 "notes": [
  "SI.2035.11.00001 was saved untaxed (item had no default tax) and deleted; Accurate does not reuse the number.",
  "Accurate amounts per invoice: I1 subtotal 1.000.000, DPP 1.000.000, PPN 110.000, total 1.110.000; I2 gross 750.000, line disc 75.000, subtotal 675.000, invoice disc 5% 33.750, DPP 641.250, PPN 70.537,5 -> 70.538, total 711.788.",
  "PI1: 4 x 150.000 = DPP 600.000, PPN 66.000, total 666.000. Purchase invoices save through bg-save-purchase-invoice.do (background job); save-purchase-invoice.do errors.",
  "I1 got its No. Faktur Pajak by re-saving the invoice; its document code stays Digunggung (customer default). Customer NL-T19-C1 is PKP (NPWP, document code Faktur Pajak), so I3 is CoreTax - Faktur Pajak. SPT Masa lists only show invoices reported in a saved SPT.",
  "NL-T19-C1 got Limit Piutang 1.000.000 (customerLimitAmount) after the invoices; CustomerLimitReport has no date parameter.",
  "R1 receives 1.200.000 for SI.2035.11.00002 (1.110.000): saved with ignoreWarning ('Ada kelebihan bayar'); the 90.000 excess is the customer's credit. An earlier receipt/return pair (NL-T1-1101.2035.11.00001, SRT.2035.11.00001) was saved and deleted: a return on a paid invoice does not create Sisa Kredit.",
  "R2 pays SI.2035.11.00004 by Cek/Giro (paymentMethod BANK_CHEQUE) dated 30 Nov 2035, cheque due 15 Dec 2035. OutstandingChequeReport needs selectedBank = [{id}] (NL-T1 Kas id 650); an empty list returns nothing.",
  "A Cek/Giro receipt posts no journal on its transaction date; Accurate journals it on the cheque date (15 Dec 2035: Dr Kas / Cr Piutang 444.000).",
  "CustomerLimitReport re-captured after R2: saldo IDR 0, Giro Mundur 444.000 (cheque not yet due at print date 18 Oct 2026), Sisa 556.000. before_cheque keeps the earlier capture (saldo IDR 444.000, USD 0).",
  "T22: payment term 'NL-T22 Cicilan' (installmentTerm, id 150); SI.2035.12.00001 carries detailSchedulePayment (installmentName/Date/Amount); the receipt line names the installment (invoiceInstallmentId) or Accurate refuses ('Cicilan harus diisi').",
  "Bank reconciliation (accurate__cash-bank__bank-reconcile): R1 reconciled manually on statement date 30 Nov 2035 via add-exist-in-bankstatement.do + save-bank-reconcile.do (tools/accurate/reconcile.mjs). 'Direkonsiliasi Oleh' prints the login user; the capture stores it as [REDACTED] and the ERP test reconciles as that name.",
  "T23 (CashProjectionReport): SI.2026.10.00014 500.000 due 20 Nov 2026 (term 'NL-T23 net 41') and PI.2026.10.00006 300.000 due 5 Dec 2026 ('NL-T23 net 54'), dated before the print date 18 Oct 2026 so they fall in the projection window. An earlier C.O.D pair (SI.2026.10.00013 / PI.2026.10.00005) was deleted."
 ],
